  {
   "id": "root",
   "x": 207,
   "y": 10,
   "w": 760,
   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "An older adult FELL: never \"mechanical\" — find EVERY cause",
   "lines": [
    "falls are almost always MULTIFACTORIAL: a thorough history (with collateral) + physical exam",
    "the leading cause of injury in older adults: fractures, brain injury, fear of falling, long-term care, death"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_a",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 248,
   "h": 62,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "1 · Is an ACUTE ILLNESS hiding behind it?",
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "g_c",
   "x": 333,
